{"id":"polmone","lemma":"polmone","pos":"noun","rank":2364,"glosses":["lung"],"ipa":"/polˈmo.ne/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"polmoni"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-Crunchy_Cloaky_Crackdown-polmone.wav","formAudio":{"polmoni":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-Ciampix-polmoni.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"È morto di cancro ai polmoni.","en":"He died of lung cancer.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"dead man"},{"g":"of"},{"g":"cancer"},null,null]},{"text":"Il coltello gli perforò il polmone.","en":"The knife punctured his lung.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"knife"},{"g":"the / to him"},null,{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Mi fanno male i polmoni.","en":"My lungs hurt.","words":[{"g":"me / myself"},{"g":"to do","l":"fare"},{"g":"evil, harm"},{"g":"the","l":"la"},null]},{"text":"L'uomo aveva un polmone forato.","en":"The man had a punctured lung.","words":[null,{"g":"person, man"},{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"pierced"}]},{"text":"Gli anfibi hanno i polmoni.","en":"Amphibians have lungs.","words":[{"g":"the / to him"},{"g":"amphibian","l":"anfibio"},{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},{"g":"the","l":"la"},null]}]}